# Recording of docs/public/gifs/march_8.gif: run by scripts/docs_gifs.sh from the root of the repository.
Output docs/public/gifs/march_8.gif
Source docs/gifs/settings.tape
Set Height 560
Hide
Type "cd build/docs-gifs/run/march_8 && export PATH=$PWD:$PATH PS1='$ ' && clear"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Show
Type "march"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 3.5s
Type "march > run.log && cat run.log"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 4s
